    "text": "With WWE and UFC thriving under the TKO banner and Zuffa Boxing now getting off the ground, many have wondered whether the company could start adding more sports or entertainment properties to its growing portfolio. According to Khan, that’s not the plan right now."
  },
  {
    "id": "b4",
